OL,3,GNEWSAChancellor to cut tariffs on some
OL,4,Afood and freeze fuel duty to give
OL,5,Afamilies 'breathing space'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe series of small announcements is
OL,8,Fpart of Chancellor John Healey's pledge
OL,9,Fto give families what he is calling
OL,10,F"breathing space" with the cost of
OL,11,Fliving.
OL,13,FThe government is also planning to end
OL,14,Fthe so-called cliff-edge for those
OL,15,Freceiving carer's allowance payments.
